**AIService**

Defined in `proto/api/v1/ai_service.proto:11`, with the RPC declared at line 13:

```
service AIService {
  // Transcribe transcribes an audio file using an instance AI provider.
  rpc Transcribe(TranscribeRequest) returns (TranscribeResponse) {
    option (google.api.http) = { post: "/api/v1/ai:transcribe" body: "*" };
    option (google.api.method_signature) = "audio";
  }
}
```

It is the only RPC on that service, exposed over HTTP as `POST /api/v1/ai:transcribe`.
